# Default code owners for all repositories in the Iwwwan-labs organization.
#
# This file is the organization-wide fallback. A repository that defines its own
# CODEOWNERS file overrides it. Ownership is granted to people or teams here, and
# owners are requested automatically for review on matching changes.
#
# Syntax: <pattern> <owner>...
# Owners must be users or teams with write access to the repository.

# Everything not matched below.
*                       @iwwwan-io

# Governance and security-sensitive files.
/SECURITY.md            @iwwwan-io
/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md     @iwwwan-io
/CODEOWNERS             @iwwwan-io

# Organization profile and shared conventions.
/profile/               @iwwwan-io
/docs/                  @iwwwan-io
/.github/               @iwwwan-io
